{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q7670263","formula":"C₃₃H₄₁ClN₆O₂","hill":"C33H41ClN6O2","elements":["H","C","N","O","Cl"],"composition":{"C":33.0,"H":41.0,"N":6.0,"O":2.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"THIQ"},"descriptions":{"en":"THIQ is a drug used in scientific research, which is the first non-peptide agonist developed that is selective for the melanocortin receptor subtype MC4. In animal studies, THIQ stimulated sexual activity in rats, but with little effect on appetite or inflammation. This supports possible application of MC4 selective agonists for the treatment of sexual dysfunction in humans, although THIQ itself has poor oral bioavailability and a short duration of action so improved analogues will need to be developed."},"fame":4,"pubchemCid":9938402,"mass":589.2,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1CCC(CC1)C2(CCN(CC2)C(=O)[C@@H](CC3=CC=C(C=C3)Cl)NC(=O)[C@H]4CC5=CC=CC=C5CN4)CN6C=NC=N6","inchikey":"HLCHESOMJVGDSJ-LOYHVIPDSA-N","iupac":"(3R)-N-[(2R)-3-(4-chlorophenyl)-1-[4-cyclohexyl-4-(1,2,4-triazol-1-ylmethyl)piperidin-1-yl]-1-oxopropan-2-yl]-1,2,3,4-tetrahydroisoquinoline-3-carboxamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"9938402","atoms":83,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-7.913,"y":-2.22,"z":-1.674,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-0.272,"y":-3.003,"z":2.382,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.74,"y":-0.38,"z":-1.311,"el":"O"},{"x":0.938,"y":-2.275,"z":0.536,"el":"N"},{"x":5.461,"y":-1.829,"z":-0.602,"el":"N"},{"x":6.48,"y":-1.004,"z":-0.882,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.779,"y":-0.903,"z":0.746,"el":"N"},{"x":7.12,"y":-2.679,"z":0.537,"el":"N"},{"x":-3.749,"y":1.867,"z":-0.286,"el":"N"},{"x":3.284,"y":-0.706,"z":-0.271,"el":"C"},{"x":3.986,"y":0.646,"z":-0.15,"el":"C"},{"x":1.882,"y":-0.495,"z":-0.889,"el":"C"},{"x":3.133,"y":-1.325,"z":1.138,"el":"C"},{"x":4.176,"y":1.284,"z":-1.534,"el":"C"},{"x":3.202,"